## Development rules

- All new features must have accompanying tests.
- Do not break existing tests; the test suite must be green after your changes.
- Follow the existing code style — don't reformat files you haven't changed.
- Keep commits atomic and well-described. Reference the issue number in the commit message.
- Do NOT push or create PRs — the orchestrator handles that.

